stateDiagram-v2
 [*] --> draft
 draft --> validated: 冻结内容并通过检查
 validated --> draft: 内容修改后检查失效
 draft --> rejected: 不可修复或无能力
 draft --> abandoned: 取消 / 主动丢弃
 validated --> accepted: CAS / 锁 / 依赖复核通过
 validated --> stale: 基础修订或依赖变化
 validated --> rejected: 最终规则阻断
 validated --> abandoned: 提交前取消
 stale --> [*]: 新候选重新校验
 rejected --> [*]
 abandoned --> [*]
 accepted --> [*]
